record('akshaya-meals-related-parties','Akshaya Patra: state support, school meals and related-party payments','A documented NGO service chain separates state-support income from cash receipts, identifies the Thakkar-funded Chikkajala kitchen and exposes the audited₹275.76lakh rent/other-expense payment to related party ISKCON Bangalore. The trust reports kitchen coverage; neither charity status nor related-party disclosure establishes misuse. No restricted government grant is traced to a particular rent payment.',asrc,['tapf-state-support','akshaya-patra','thakkar-foundation','chikkajala-kitchen','iskcon-bangalore'],['states-tapf-income','thakkar-kitchen','tapf-kitchen','tapf-iskcon-related','tapf-iskcon-rent'],ad,['funding','services','organisations','review'],'FY2024-25; kitchen inaugurated30Sep2024; audited statements signed7Oct2025','This is a funding-transparency case, with no fraud allegation asserted. The Foundation’s audited statements disclose the related parties and transaction categories. Walker Chandiok & Co LLP gave an unmodified financial-statement opinion with emphasis on the adopted trust accounting basis. Programme narrative describes school nutrition work; it is not the same assurance as an independent service-outcome audit.',['Income and cash receipts differ because of the accounting basis, in-kind support, receivables, provisions and advances. Their difference is not automatically loss.','Related organisations may legitimately share premises and services. Assessing value requires the lease, allocation basis and comparable charges.','A kitchen’s capacity or inauguration promise may exceed period-end children actually served.'],'Reconcile government sanctions and bank credits to ScheduleB and grain support; match kitchen registers to school acknowledgments; inspect leases, common-trustee approvals, cost allocation and market comparisons before asserting excess or grant misuse.',aamount,'documented','Audited financial disclosures retained; programme delivery is self-reported; no misconduct finding asserted','2025-10-07','2024-04-01','2025-10-07',ag,['Foundation totals, kitchen capital expenditure and related-party payments overlap in scope and must not be totalled.','Cash/income records include non-school nutrition operations. No national outcome or per-child subsidy is calculated.','A public figure’s presence at an inauguration creates no funding or influence edge.'])

